        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsberg asked whether the Court should overrule Nevada v. Hall or treat this case as different because it involves core sovereign functions."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d87ef8ddee07a499ff25f8ac131c741d1172673dfcd5f03509027b5a18ce0f5d",
