            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 11,
              "start": 11
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Stevens asked whether a hypothetical California statute authorizing thumbscrews would grant absolute immunity in Nevada."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d87ef8ddee07a499ff25f8ac131c741d1172673dfcd5f03509027b5a18ce0f5d",
