            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Leatherwood, the case involves a dispute between California and Nevada over whether Nevada must honor California's tax immunity statutes."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "d87ef8ddee07a499ff25f8ac131c741d1172673dfcd5f03509027b5a18ce0f5d",
