              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Franchise Tax Board of California, the FTBC argued that the case is analogous to the Federal Tax Injunction Act fair assessment jurisprudence, where the federal government backs off from managing state taxes."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "Franchise Tax Board of California",
      "status": "complete",
