              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-d87ef8ddee07-0001-0000"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 19,
                "start": 19
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Leatherwood, he argued that Nevada's failure to recognize California's immunity statute violates the Full Faith and Credit Clause and constitutes hostility."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Leatherwood",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "d87ef8ddee07a499ff25f8ac131c741d1172673dfcd5f03509027b5a18ce0f5d",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-d87ef8ddee07-0002-0003"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 50,
                "start": 50
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Leatherwood, he contended that the Full Faith and Credit Clause would not force Nevada to apply a California thumbscrew statute because it lies outside the tax function."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "Mr. Leatherwood",
      "status": "complete",
      "summary": null,
      "summary_citations": []
    },
    {
