              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 25,
                "start": 24
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Farr, he expressed that the issue is not about choosing between California and Nevada law, but about determining which Nevada law would apply."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Farr",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "d87ef8ddee07a499ff25f8ac131c741d1172673dfcd5f03509027b5a18ce0f5d",
